          "Text": "The Mandelbrot set, the black shape in the middle. Its Smooth output, how fast each point escapes, runs a Cosine Gradient, and the Master Gear cycles the palette so color streams out of the set. Drag Center X, Center Y and Zoom to explore; raise Iterations as you zoom in."
